  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5243d49411170e49a1bac6c9ca10949, type: 3}
  m_Name: Passage_Act3_ArrivalSchool
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SundayLastBreath.Data.StoryPassageData
  passageId: Act3_ArrivalSchool
  passageTitle: ACT3 ARRIVALSCHOOL
  associatedRoomId: security_foyer
  backdropSprite: {fileID: 0}
  keepPreviousBackdrop: 0
  animatedBackdropFrames: []
  animationFPS: 8
  musicAction: 0
  backgroundMusicOrAmbience: {fileID: 0}
  musicVolume: 0.5
  entranceSFX: {fileID: 0}
  sfxVolume: 0.8
  speakerName: 
  storyText: "/* =====================================================================\r\n   ACT 3: ARRIVAL \u2014 INITIALIZATION & STATE SETUP\r\n   ===================================================================== */"
  narrativeBeats:
  - /* 1. Track Player Location for the SVG Map */
  - /* Loads the West Wing SVG */
  - /* 2. Setup Safehouse Variables & Testing Fallbacks */
  - "/* Complete arrival objective and sweep HUD */\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    /* Create a stash to hold the player's taken gear */\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    /* AUDIO: Highschool Exterior Ambiance */"
  - "/* \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n   PHASE 1 \u2014 THE BARRICADES\r\n   \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 */"
  - "TIMBERLINE REGIONAL \u2014 THE GATES"
  - You bring the car to a halt in front of the fortified highschool gates. Overturned school buses form a rigid perimeter.
  - "In the gray morning light, the scale of the sanctuary is clear. Armed guards patrol the rooftops.\r\n                \r\n                    Blinding halogen floodlights instantly snap onto your windshield, pinning you in the dark."
  - '"KILL THE ENGINE! HANDS WHERE WE CAN SEE THEM!" a voice bellows through a megaphone.'
  - "/* -----------------------------------------------------\r\n                       ARRIVAL WITH REYES (Easy Entry)\r\n                       ----------------------------------------------------- */\r\n                    Before you can react, Reyes opens the passenger door and steps out into the light. She raises her police badge high."
  - The tension instantly evaporates. The rifles lower. A heavy chain rattles, and the massive steel gate slowly drags open.
  - '[REYES] She vouches for you. You bypass the hostile interrogation.'
  - "/* -----------------------------------------------------\r\n                       ARRIVAL ALONE / WITH CIVILIANS (Hostile Entry)\r\n                       ----------------------------------------------------- */\r\n                    You put the car in park and slowly raise your hands. Three guards approach the vehicle, rifles leveled directly at your chest."
  - They yank your door open, dragging you out onto the wet asphalt. They pat you down roughly, checking for bites.
  - "0>>\r\n                        They pull your companions out of the car next, forcing you all into a tight line."
  - '"No bites," one of the guards grunts. "They''re clean. Move them inside to Screening."'
  - You don't have a choice. You are escorted into the building at gunpoint.
  - "/* \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n   PHASE 2 \u2014 THE SCREENING ROOM (CONFISCATION)\r\n   \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 */"
  - "TIMBERLINE REGIONAL \u2014 SCREENING ROOM"
  - You are brought into what used to be a generic utility classroom. Now, it's a sterile intake zone. A grizzled, exhausted man with a military buzzcut stands behind a foldable table covered in weapons.
  - He points a thick finger at your gear.
  - Reyes gives you a subtle nod. She has to surrender her shotgun too.
  - "/* Move weapons from inventory to stash */\r\n                            = 0; _i-->>\r\n                                \r\n                                \r\n                                    \r\n                                    \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            \r\n                            \r\n                            \r\n                            \r\n                            \r\n                        \r\n                        [+10 TRUST] Comply with base rules. Your weapons are moved to the Locker Room."
  - "= 3>>\r\n                         setup.items[i.id].type == \"weapon\" && setup.items[i.id].desc.includes(\"pistol\") || setup.items[i.id].desc.includes(\"blade\"))>>\r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                                    \r\n                                    /* Logic to keep one small weapon, stash the rest */\r\n                                    \r\n                                    = 0; _i-->>\r\n                                        \r\n                                        \r\n                                            \r\n                                                \r\n                                                \r\n                                            \r\n                                                \r\n                                                \r\n                                            \r\n                                        \r\n                                    \r\n                                    \r\n                                    \r\n                                    \r\n                                    \r\n                                \r\n                                [DIPLOMAT / LIE DETECTOR / STEALTH 3] Distract Vance just long enough to slip a pistol or knife into your boot. He takes the heavy gear."
  - "/* \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n   PHASE 3 \u2014 RELEASED INTO THE HUB\r\n   \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550 */"
  - "TIMBERLINE REGIONAL \u2014 FOYER"
  - Vance tags your gear and shoves it into a heavy canvas bag.
  - You feel the cold steel of your  pressed against your ribs. He didn't notice a thing.
  - The heavy metal doors click open. You step out into the sprawling, fortified highschool. You made it. You are safe. For now.
  - '[FREE ROAM] Explore the highschool, talk to survivors, and trade supplies.'
  dialogueLines:
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Stand down! It's Deputy Reyes! I've got survivors with me. Open the damn gate!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Drive through. Park near the foyer. I'll handle the intake.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Sgt. Vance
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75ddbd3fc3b3df6ee8d282c35e71fe95, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: 'I''m Sergeant Vance, Quartermaster. Welcome to Timberline. If you want to stay, you follow the rules. Rule number one: No civilian carries primary firearms inside the perimeter.'
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Sgt. Vance
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75ddbd3fc3b3df6ee8d282c35e71fe95, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Hand over the long guns and the heavy ordinance. You'll get a receipt. You can check them out when you go on patrol. But in here, you're unarmed.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: I'm going upstairs to brief the Commander. Sit tight. Stay out of trouble. I'll come get you when they're ready to see you.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Sgt. Vance
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 75ddbd3fc3b3df6ee8d282c35e71fe95, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: The Commander is dealing with a crisis on the 1st Floor right now. You wait down here. Canteen is down the hall. Infirmary is across the foyer. Don't make me hunt you down.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  initialFloorItems: []
